<title>UK: Taylor Woodrow pretax profits up 81 pct.</title>
<headline>Taylor Woodrow pretax profits up 81 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		4.4		    vs 2.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.0		    vs 0.75</p>
<p> Pretax		     25.4		   vs 14.0</p>
<p> Turnover		   556.4		  vs 547.4</p>
<p>NOTE- Taylor Woodrow is a construction, property development and housebuilding group.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 29.4		   vs 16.9</p>
<p> Interest payable	 6.1		    vs 5.5</p>
<p> Tax			  7.1		    vs 3.9</p>
<p> Net taxed		  18.3		   vs 10.1</p>
<p> Pay date		   November 1</p>
<p> Div registration date  October  1</p>
<p> Ex-div date		September 23</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
